<Rive version="1" kind="fragment">
    <!-- paid - the moment an invoice is paid.

         This is the reward loop for someone who has probably never been paid
         for their work before, so it is deliberately a bit much: the badge
         lands with an elastic overshoot and two rings ping outward from it.

         Flat colour throughout - no gradient, no glow, no blur. The site's
         design system is three warm surfaces and one accent, and a celebratory
         asset is exactly where that discipline usually gets broken.

         The mark is generated by tools/svg2rml.py from site/img/favicon.svg;
         the counters read as accent because the fill is evenOdd over the disc. -->

    <Artboard defaultStateMachineId="0:7" styleId="0:5" width="600" height="600" name="Paid" id="0:2">
        <LayoutComponentStyle name="Artboard Style" id="0:5"/>

